{"id":"aparte","lemma":"aparte","pos":"adv","rank":1388,"glosses":["separately, apart (usually followed by de)","aside, aside from (when followed by de)"],"ipa":"/aˈpaɾte/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/51/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-aparte.wav","examples":[{"text":"Eso es cuestión aparte.","en":"That's another issue.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454219"},{"text":"Tienes que cocinarlos aparte.","en":"You have to cook them separately.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/930743"},{"text":"Lavaré las sábanas aparte.","en":"I'll wash the bedsheets separately.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/728600"},{"text":"No sé nada aparte de esto.","en":"I know nothing but this.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/707288"},{"text":"Sé muy poco aparte de eso.","en":"I know very little beyond that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/297760"}]}